  "details": "Expected / previous behavior: \nWorld portals would send any player that enters to the same instance until that instance was filled\nSteps to repro:\n1. Find a world that has a portal / is using the Portal Marker\n2. Have 'User 1' enter the portal (Instance number will appear)\n3. Wait ~30 seconds (Instance number will disappear - wait a few seconds after)\n4. Have 'User 2' enter the same portal\nThe two users will not end up in the same instance.\nBehavior happens on live and current open beta (1142)",
